    {
      "id": "claim_aeaad7dd8820463488b8092706bb1a4d",
      "statement": "Provider data is normalised into InRes's own representation — UptimeRobot integer status and type codes are mapped to names and its combined uptime-ratio string is split into 1-day, 7-day, 30-day and all-time figures, while Checkly status is derived from a check's failure, error and degraded flags.",
